  "description": "The phrase 'breed you should not' uses a dehumanizing metaphor to strip the target of their humanity by implying they are unfit to reproduce. This is a real-world concept often used in hate speech and propaganda to justify discrimination or violence. It is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's intent to dehumanize and condemn.",
